WEBVTT

00:03:57.246 --> 00:04:01.663
I have a paper calendar, I've had
a paper calendar for decades,

00:04:01.996 --> 00:04:06.538
and my dad used to send me the American
Express book calendar,

00:04:06.538 --> 00:04:11.079
which I used to use, and then he passed
away. So I needed another vehicle.

00:04:11.371 --> 00:04:13.663
And so I just have this
little paper calendar.

00:04:13.663 --> 00:04:18.121
It's actually little, but it's two year
calendar and I am attached to this thing.

00:04:18.121 --> 00:04:19.288
It goes with me everywhere.

00:04:19.329 --> 00:04:21.871
So I didn't even answer your question.
So how am I dealing with it?

00:04:23.246 --> 00:04:25.746
The first thing I was kind of in denial.

00:04:25.746 --> 00:04:28.996
Like a lot of people, what I decided is

00:04:28.996 --> 00:04:32.621
the pandemic would last about
eight weeks at least.